ind_retry_timeout"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-2024-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 41425, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01JyEjUyo7es7PYQggS8EkSm", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 42909, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged the on-call engineer.\n\n- **Before:** v2.3.1 was live everywhere, unhealthy, with an error rate of 0.18.\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent production release marked healthy. Redeploying it did not need change-manager approval.\n- **After:** v2.3.0 is live in all three regions, healthy, with an error rate of 0.002.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback, and the post-rollback state. It also says v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until someone finds the root cause.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_0175sGb579vRB4wax2ofv17G", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01AEbTurMEXAWDSaAC8JkvNG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The current production version is v2.3.1, which is unhealthy. The most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0 (seq 1), so I'll roll back to it.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01FqcVYhcwPKH3fnhGYqZTBB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"s